The Puppeteer script now uses `headless: 'new'` (no X11 needed) and `setRequestInterception` to capture the exact headers the browser sends when Expert is selected. The dangling scan shows every fork with continued vs abandoned counts so you can tune thresholds. The sprints board is now accessible via `synthegration sprints`.

